<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
    <comment location="TextureViewHandle">
        <summary> A TextureView is a view onto some subset of the <see
                href="https://gpuweb.github.io/gpuweb/#texture-subresources"> texture subresources</see>
            defined by a particular <see cref="WebGpuSharp.Texture" />. </summary>
    </comment>
    <group prefix="TextureViewHandle.">
        <comment location="SetLabel">
            <summary>Set the label of the texture view.</summary>
            <param name="label">The label to set.</param>
        </comment>
    </group>
</group>